  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "鐵屜內一siū niáu鼠"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/hSjXNusB6YQ?si=eTfGpb4lOF7RZNbH\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">作者：</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>張淑真</b></span></p><p><br /></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">聽隔壁老人講in兜ê半暝，天pông頂不時有人leh跳làng-sù，無兩工，電話bē通，通訊行師傅來查看佗位故障，試規晡，tang時仔是天pông頂ê電話線hō͘ niáu鼠咬斷--去；原來食siuⁿ飽，暗時chiah ē弄鐃pìⁿ猴弄。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Bē堪得氣，先買黏糊片仔來黏，天光soah黏著無辜ê蟮尪仔，阿貓倚去鼻看māi，伸手póe，險險仔hō͘黏--著。厝內ē食--得ê mi̍h件收離離，連pùn-sò mā無，莫怪in腹肚iau chiah烏白咬、亂sú gè。氣--到-tè，就koh khai錢買一跤tng niáu鼠ê鐵籠仔，請in食chìⁿ雞排chiah kā活掠--khiaih。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">暝半chiâⁿ恬靜，啥人知影天光早仔，niáu鼠籠仔空空，雞排食kah無骨無屑，mā無khoàiⁿ阿鼠影，好厲害ê紅狗蟻！只好去揣里長討niáu鼠藥仔，厝邊pun-pheⁿ，siàⁿ-siàⁿ niáu鼠ē peh公寓ê水管，chiâⁿ gâu liú空過家chhńg食。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">聽講tng不如thāu，chit-móa ê thāu料芳，siâⁿ ē tiâu iau飢失頓ê阿鼠，伊若食--loeh ē喙ta，sì-kè揣水，m̄是un tī灶跤就是tī hú-looh間死死昏昏--去。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Chit爿戶日--時影著一隻大khian--ê leh咬pùn-sò桶，摃伊bē著，跤手liâm-chia̍p竄leh lōng，看伊鑽入壁邊鐵桌仔縫。到 boeh暗仔，哪ē聽見鐵屜仔內khi-khi-kho̍k-kho̍k，穩當bih tī hia，而且有幼聲幼聲leh chhi-chhi-chhu̍h-chhu̍h。啊！Taⁿ chit聲bē直--ah，竟然踮屜仔內做siū生囝。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">獨居老人一時驚惶，sòa手將屜仔縫sak ba̍t，手leh chhoah，m̄敢徛桌仔邊；鼠母kho̍k-kho̍k挵鐵屜，khi̍h-khia̍k khi̍h-khia̍k ê聲連sòa三工，一工比一工khah細聲，第四工lóng無聲無soeh，老人iáu是m̄敢thuah開屜仔。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">頭一暝囥六粒藥丸，無hìⁿ-haiⁿ，第二工chiah sut兩粒，pān-phoe boeh公母雙隻雙掠，去揣有水食ê所在也無khoàiⁿ身屍。賰hit四粒藥丸，m̄知別隻kám ē來鼻芳？經過一工一暝無動無靜，規氣chhiàⁿ清潔公司來收拾鐵屜仔hit siū niáu鼠。若無，m̄知boeh生湠偌大陣，liam-mi tio̍h鼠che就hiau-hēng，愈想愈tio̍h生驚愈睏bē去。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">鐵屜仔thoah--開，鼠母已經死giān-giān，六隻無毛、紅紅幼幼ê niáu鼠嬰仔，tī老母ê腹肚頂ngia̍uh-ngia̍uh-nǹg suh無奶。老人雞母皮chhàng掠外長，跤手肉khu̍h-khu̍h-chhoah，清潔sai--ê先kā老--ê sa khiaih tàn loeh pùn-sò袋仔，紅嬰仔真知死，隨kho̍k-kho̍k-nǹg，bih入去屜仔內ê文件縫，ki-ki叫chông boeh逃生。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Sai--ê chiâⁿ有經驗，手掛棉紗手套一隻一隻出大力tēⁿ--loeh，chi̍h、chi̍h、一聲過一聲，chi̍h--一-聲，niáu鼠仔囝出世iáu未開目ê性命就結束tī pùn-sò堆，大詳食khah少毒母奶hit隻，趁人khiú出鐵屜放落塗跤拍坦khi hit-tia̍p，iáu ē拚命跳--出-去，soah挵著壁角，昏--去bē tín bē動。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Niáu鼠仔囝in老母ê鬥陣--ê，早就làng港，可憐出世無老爸疼惜，老母中毒也m̄甘放sak親生囝，鼠母iáu想boeh飼囝、顧囝，甘願khîⁿ囝到最後一點khùi，囡仔哪ē知影有thang活幾工？</span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh_qCwhGRdwOrCjzb1ZZqpL92SFf5RzX0IEMONzPd7neADHMPz6ZtyFGyXZUTLTRpaGHOYTJE7lowS-qYjtEzBxnrS0fajhXfMbinWz4FZBrszxUcDnsnXN4GgR062ui3HXPbGi4kDky60w56AMTVTjfjvgn1EBOcEb2S8-4CFZOiyAqvgKuPLbH4F74O4G/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1370%E6%9C%9F_44